<Layout
  title="How We Score and Select Tools — OpenSourceStack Methodology"
  description="The detailed methodology behind OpenSourceStack listings: how we pick projects, how we score security and quality, and how the editorial process works."
>
  <div class="container-page max-w-3xl py-16 prose-mdx">
    <nav class="text-xs text-ink-500 mb-6 font-mono not-prose">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink-300">Home</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
      <a href="/about" class="hover:text-ink-300">About</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
